# Rendered outputs are never committed (owner, 2026-10-18). Every PNG below is
# produced by a build, render or compose script in its package; regenerate it
# instead. Sources stay tracked: Codex/ImageGen generations with their prompts,
# the guides they were generated from, finish references and story stills.
*-geometry/**/*.png
second-wind-vfx/**/*.png
second-wind-surface/review/
second-wind-surface/textures/
second-wind-projection-spike/review-sheet*.png
second-wind-cinematic/second-wind-states/**/*.png
hound-surface/review/
hound-surface/textures/

# Cinematic rendered outputs, as classified by the cinematic session
# (2026-10-18). Only the images: review mp4s stay until the owner decides,
# and review notes and metrics are small text that stays tracked.
second-wind-cinematic/**/review/**/*.png
second-wind-cinematic/**/review/**/*.jpg
second-wind-cinematic/corvus-approach/layers/*.png
second-wind-cinematic/nessas-yard/layers/*.png
second-wind-cinematic/road-and-port/cards/*.png
second-wind-cinematic/corvus-approach/assets/planet-height-v2.png
second-wind-cinematic/corvus-approach/assets/planet-lights-v2.png
second-wind-cinematic/corvus-approach/assets/planet-ocean-v2.png
second-wind-cinematic/second-wind-surface-proof/daylight-contact-preview.png
second-wind-cinematic/second-wind-surface-proof/projected-port-quarter.png
second-wind-cinematic/second-wind-surface-proof/projected-port-side.png
